# Time.dt starts at 1.0 / 60. Before any tick Time.tick is 0 and Time.elapsed
# is 0.0; after one tick elapsed has gone up by dt. A tick with no systems is
# still a tick.
puts Time.tick
puts Time.elapsed
puts Time.dt == 1.0 / 60
puts Time.dt
World.tick
puts Time.tick
puts Time.elapsed == 1.0 / 60
puts Time.elapsed
